 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000After a long journey, the guest finally arrives at the hotel. This moment — the check-in — is very important. It is the guest's first real experience inside the hotel. A slow or cold check-in makes a bad start; a warm, quick check-in makes the guest feel at home at once.":{f:"abe2e78d7dc0f80a",d:18.624,v:0.773,a:0.160,b:17.800,wd:[0.2, 0.59, 0.72, 1.04, 1.62, 1.84, 2.26, 2.88, 3.29, 3.49, 3.74, 4.19, 4.44, 4.97, 5.1, 5.28, 6.04, 6.06, 6.25, 6.68, 7.29, 7.48, 7.67, 8.04, 8.44, 8.88, 9.16, 9.86, 10.31, 10.57, 11.02, 11.15, 11.47, 11.67, 12.04, 12.57, 12.92, 13.16, 13.34, 13.79, 13.92, 14.31, 14.69, 15.28, 15.72, 15.92, 16.28, 16.64, 16.82, 17.14, 17.33],e:"00000llQ0RhgjPNZZXWRQEKQQQONLIGE00000UPDShYJK0E00XVXVWURQOPOIPYVUPFIQWD0PJIOL0HDRSPLJG0000000000000000000000000E-",w:"00---cSy-WDDGEEMMJHA6U-RIFHQmXUIS----Zd9ncX------IMULBDGXVXL8BPTbZ---QNtPSVHEl--USRIB97h----0000000000000000----Wh---BHIEEJSQK6-----Wd--uZSo-ciaK4Bs---m---jNRNPXcX89-oBIJC664E------00000000000000000---gcaY--xWQ-bfbq-------GIL----9DPMGSZV----KKMNQSRA---QB---QZX9USiIII--eXUNEB6N----00000000000000000---d----qMTKEB8EDc--PLP8--+XT+-WU939fb+--M9UXWVQE----ePLLIEE------K968ADIPLD44d----+Ndp----VWn-YbC68ch+---OW9vfc------NgZLIWQ--oGC8IH738IQOG7z---------0000000000000000",r:"--000PZ30VoolnnffikrvX0ajmkbFUXjZ0000SOsEPU000000jfXgqolUWUgtqcYQS000be8cZWknG00XZajqsuK0000----------------0000VK000qkjnniZbhv00000WO007SZD0PJRhxq9000F000IeaecUPUts0Dqjipvvxn000000-----------------000LPRT004Wb0QMQB0000000ljg0000socflZSW0000hhfebZar000bq000bSUsXZJjjj00NUXenqve0000-----------------000O0000BfYhnqtnoP00cgct001UY10VXsysMQ100fsXUVWbn0000Ncggjnn000000hsvtrojcgoxxO00001eOC0000WWE0TQpvtPK1000dVs6MP000000eLSgjWb00Dlptjkuytjbdlu2000000000----------------"},
