 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000Dear Ms. Khalil, this is a note to confirm your arrangements. We're giving you a wake-up call at 5:30 tomorrow. A taxi is waiting for you at the entrance at 6:00. The porter is going to help with your bags. Have a good journey! Kind regards, Reception.":{f:"2e9547bb0fce6dd3",d:19.032,v:0.719,a:0.160,b:18.240,wd:[0.2, 0.55, 0.84, 1.41, 1.76, 1.92, 2.08, 2.47, 2.68, 3.16, 3.61, 4.6, 5.03, 5.52, 5.88, 5.9, 6.48, 6.87, 7.09, 7.44, 8.24, 8.26, 8.6, 8.96, 9.36, 9.71, 10.0, 10.2, 10.44, 11.13, 11.35, 11.8, 12.0, 12.55, 12.76, 13.19, 13.4, 13.76, 14.11, 14.47, 14.96, 15.25, 15.39, 15.75, 16.39, 16.74, 17.48],e:"-hXtrgRK0QbXWQTSJShG00WD0NWIDecZXSNI00GII00000000000000000000000000QtImK0goNEMZZYVUSOKG0000000000000000000000000EUvkUDXVE0ejdZUPG0LE0000DTPNOrf0IRNSPKKIE000000000000000000000",w:"00----jWOEAMZ----WLCSsnmRGA4U--l-Z-----cSDCWSK8n-S--QCP--QJE8HKIGE8LZbGf--AGJ66---------0000000000000000---4GP8-cPelGBUNJJC4Dc+---SI++--QPNJDDOJ---LZeT--WNIDWcY--9BDIKLLJD84b----0000000000000000---gWl--tgZj---Zgj---IcnSbY9--LPNYQCHWSwgholY9--OP9--TPb---Z---Wb--vLQNLLS-------00000000000000000---MDb-jDIHTIHL---FDJL4Xh-ZNGkzKs-PG4UPedZVNB6----------0000000000000000----uZ-ND-ZT86-WNKKPsjYRb-----0000000000000000----gWeE-FJ5-KNNQLJ5-------JH---TNl---SQN42Ar---00000000000000000",r:"--0000IWdnrfS0000WgpZ9EFalrxX00G0S00000PZopWZhtE0Z00bpc00bintkhjlntgSQlM00rlivv000000000----------------000xlct0PcNGlqXeiipxoP1000Zj1100bceioodi000gSNY00WejoWPT00sqojhggiotxQ0000----------------000LWG008LSI000SLI000jPEZQTs00gceTbpkVZ5LKDGTs00dcs00YcQ000S000WQ006gbeggZ0000000-----------------000foQ0IojkYjkg000moigxUK0SelH2h90clxXcNOSWeqv0000000000----------------00007S0eo0SYtv0Wehhc9ITaQ00000----------------0000LWNn0miw0heebgiw0000000ik000YeG000ZbexzrA000-----------------"},
 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000Finally, the receptionist hands over the room with a warm wish: “Enjoy your stay.” In less than five minutes, the guest has gone from a tired traveller to a welcome guest. That is the power of a perfect check-in — and it is a skill that every great hotel values highly.":{f:"72971160ec89ab87",d:16.968,v:0.740,a:0.240,b:16.120,wd:[0.28, 0.92, 0.94, 1.8, 2.15, 2.44, 2.72, 2.97, 3.26, 3.37, 3.64, 4.02, 4.42, 4.72, 5.12, 5.3, 5.52, 5.92, 6.12, 6.72, 6.96, 7.28, 7.6, 7.88, 8.1, 8.22, 8.57, 9.15, 9.36, 9.38, 9.91, 10.32, 10.61, 10.79, 11.0, 11.32, 11.48, 11.66, 12.08, 12.64, 12.77, 13.0, 13.16, 13.35, 13.47, 13.76, 14.16, 14.52, 14.8, 15.16, 15.6],e:"0000000o-",w:"00-----NUcfDQLEejcWMv--xNFK---aRh---KJN-----bZSC--OE-IOjL98BHKG99HM-JA449FIE988LSQR--------fD8--EEMQSLX----gccZZWXu----00----------------smSEGQWY---II8--YOUSxeAXYJZNKI--------iI4-cda----Z---dLKM9--GCMK---XSSRNG9--ZQSK-DIDBX--CD838NPDc-G63-WeaWSP----------00000000000000000--xUXbWfc--iNO--xQJBGLMNhKBb-xKH-vXZx---XW--bhZTE2B------sgFgP+My--j-----KQRLXWZmxbXK-IS9--GPYg---II---RMIQxbXWWbRN----RadXICSUPPp-----00000000000000000",r:"--00000eXPMobgnNIPVf6004emh000RaK000hie00000QSZp00dn0jdIgstqkhlsskf0irxxsmjnsttgZba00000000Mot00nnfbZgU0000LPPSSWU70000--00000000000000009FZnlbVT000jjt00TdXZ4NrUTiSehj00000000Jjx0POR0000S000Oghfs00lpfh000UZZaels00SbZh0ojoqU00potytecoP0lvy0VNRVZc0000000000-----------------004XUQVMP00Jed004biqlgfeKhqQ04hk06US4000UW00QKSYnzq0000009LmLc1f300I00000hbagUWSF4QUh0jZs00lcTL000jj000afjb4QUWVQae0000aROUjpZXccC00000-----------------"},
